1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:04,160
Burung kakaktua ternyata pernah
hinggap di istana kaisar Eropa,

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:06,420
sekitar 800 tahun lalu...

3
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:09,700
jauh sebelum orang Eropa
sampai ke Nusantara!

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,920
Ia digambar di kitab sang kaisar...

5
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,253
dan katanya,

6
00:00:13,253 --> 00:00:14,740
bisa bicara!

7
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:15,440
Tapi,

8
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,170
bagaimana bisa sampai?

9
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:18,560
Ilmuwan menduga,

10
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,480
ia dibawa perahu ke Jawa,

11
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,787
lalu Tiongkok,

12
00:00:21,787 --> 00:00:23,600
lewat Jalur Sutra ke Mesir...

13
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,860
lalu dihadiahkan Sultan
Mesir sebagai tanda damai!

14
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:27,520
Follow,

15
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,860
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
